    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Cosmos Milk Tea</strong>, a narrative adventure and simulation game born from AI-native design.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set aboard a space station, you play as Lily \u2014 milk tea maker by day, bartender by night. Serve drinks, chat with AI-powered customers who each have unique personalities and memories. Your conversations aren\u2019t scripted \u2014 they're dynamic, personal, and can shape the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As bonds grow, you\u2019ll unlock new recipes and uncover hidden truths about the universe, artificial intelligence\u2026 and yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>AI-Driven Characters</strong>: Talk freely with intelligent NPCs who remember, react, and evolve.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Day &amp; Night Gameplay</strong>: Manage your caf\u00e9 by day, connect deeply by night.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Creative Drink System</strong>: Mix ingredients to craft unique cosmic milk teas.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Cosmos Milk Tea</strong>, a narrative adventure and simulation game born from AI-native design.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set aboard a space station, you play as Lily \u2014 milk tea maker by day, bartender by night. Serve drinks, chat with AI-powered customers who each have unique personalities and memories. Your conversations aren\u2019t scripted \u2014 they're dynamic, personal, and can shape the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As bonds grow, you\u2019ll unlock new recipes and uncover hidden truths about the universe, artificial intelligence\u2026 and yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>AI-Driven Characters</strong>: Talk freely with intelligent NPCs who remember, react, and evolve.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Day &amp; Night Gameplay</strong>: Manage your caf\u00e9 by day, connect deeply by night.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Creative Drink System</strong>: Mix ingredients to craft unique cosmic milk teas.</p></li></ul>",
